  ($d$qwen/qwen3-vl-flash-2025-10-15$d$::text, 'dba8c6dc3d2d'::text, $d$Qwen3 VL Flash (2025-10-15) is a fast, efficient vision-language model from Alibaba's Qwen3-VL series. It supports text, image, and video input with a 1M token context window.$d$::text),
  ($d$qwen/qwen3-vl-flash-2026-01-22$d$::text, 'bd8e7d707d94'::text, $d$Qwen3 VL Flash (2026-01-22) is a fast, efficient vision-language model from Alibaba's Qwen3-VL series. It supports text, image, and video input with a 1M token context window.$d$::text),
