  ($d$qwen/qwen3.5-4b$d$::text, '697164a6c90b'::text, $d$Qwen 3.5 4B is a small multimodal model in the Qwen team's Qwen3.5 series. It accepts text and image inputs and produces text outputs.$d$::text),
